    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        145,
        1027,
        1114,
        1135
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "2. All permanent employees in the competitive class or the labor class who are in the employ of the various Borough Presidents on the effective day of this executive order and who are performing duties in connection with the care, maintenance and operation of such burial grounds, shall be transferred to the Department of Real Estate in",
